The files in this folder are copied from shadcn/ui
(https://github.com/shadcn-ui/ui, apps/v4/registry/new-york-v4/ui at commit
295a1f114a138f23b5dfee0e0c6812394dfeb90c), with import paths pointed at
@/lib/utils. button.tsx and badge.tsx also replace text-white on the
destructive variant with text-destructive-foreground and drop the
dark:bg-destructive/60 overlay (copied from quirq-ai/monitoring at dd0e680, where
its AGENTS.md requires this). They are used under
the licence below.

